      "content": "APIs for authentication methods in HashiCorp Vault including Token, AppRole, Kubernetes, LDAP, JWT/OIDC, GitHub, Userpass, and AWS auth methods. These endpoints handle user and machine authentication to obtain Vault tokens.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: HashiCorp Support\n Email: support@hashicorp.com",
